{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31373","headline":"题越王楼寄献中丞使君 · 刘暌","name":"题越王楼寄献中丞使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱轩迥压碧烟州，昔岁贤王是胜游。\n山簇劒峰朝阙远，水如巴字遶城流。\n人间物象分千里，天上笙歌醉五侯。\n今日登临无限意，同沾惠化自销愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘暌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}